#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:223
msgid "File manager overlay icons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:225
msgid "For classic sync folders, the desktop client adds overlay icons to files in the file manager. A green checkmark means a file is up to date. A warning icon can mean that a file is ignored; a red X indicates a sync error. A blue icon indicates a file waiting to sync or currently syncing. When the client is offline, it does not show overlays for the folder's current sync state."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:230
msgid "A folder's overlay reflects sync errors in its contents. Ignored files do not change the parent folder's status. On macOS, File Provider uses the standard Finder status indicators described in :doc:`macosfileprovider`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:234
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:236
msgid "The desktop client integrates sharing actions into Finder on macOS and Explorer on Windows. On Linux, install the integration package for your file manager, such as ``nautilus-nextcloud`` or ``dolphin-nextcloud``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:239
msgid "In your file manager, right-click a file and select **Nextcloud** > **Share options** to open the share dialog."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:241
msgid "Use **Search for recipients** to share the file with people or groups. Existing shares and share links appear below the search field. Use the copy button to copy an internal link or share link. Use the three-dot menu to edit a share, or the **X** button to remove it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:245
msgid "Sharing overview with recipient search, existing shares, and link controls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:250
msgid "When you edit a share, choose the recipient's permission from the dropdown menu. You can also add a note for the recipients. Changes are applied immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:253
msgid "Share details with recipients, permissions, and a note to recipients"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:258
msgid "Open **Sharing settings** with the gear button to set an expiration date or protect the share with a password. Changes are applied immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/usage.rst:261
msgid "Advanced sharing settings for expiration date and password protection"
msgstr ""
